  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution towards the UNDP Government Support Programme aiming at the development of a global governance strategy covering the roles andfunctions of the public/private and central/local interfaces as well as the relations between them will be developed. Developing of de- tailed management plans for entities at different levels.</narrative>
